{title: Over In The Glory Land}
{key: G}
{x_theme: praise, heaven, joy, salvation}
{x_source: chrd:over_in_the_glory_land.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]I've a home prepared where the [C]saints a[G]bide
Over in the [A7]glory [D7]land
I [G]long to be by my [C]Savior's [G]side
Over in the [D7]glory [G]land

{comment: Chorus}
Just [G]over in the glory land
I'll [C]join (yes join) the happy angel [G]band
Over in the [A7]glory [D7]land
[G]Just over in the glory land
There [C]with (yes with) the mighty host I'll [G]stand
Over in the [D7]glory [G]land

{comment: Verse 2}
I'm on my way to those [C]mansions [G]fair
Over in the [A7]glory [D7]land
There to [G]sing God's praises and [C]His glory [G]share
Over in the [D7]glory [G]land

{comment: Verse 3}
What a joyful thought that my [C]Lord I'll [G]see
Over in the [A7]glory [D7]land
And with [G]kindred saved there [C]forever I'll [G]be
Over in the [D7]glory [G]land
